## 3. 数据模型设计

### 3.1 约束信息模型
```python
class ConstraintInfo(BaseModel):
    """约束信息传输模型"""
    model_config = ConfigDict(protected_namespaces=())

    # FSM状态机约束
    fsm_enabled: bool = False
    current_state: Optional[str] = None
    allowed_tokens: Optional[List[str]] = None

    # GBNF语法约束
    gbnf_enabled: bool = False
    grammar_rules: Optional[str] = None

    # 域特定约束
    domain_constraints: Dict[str, Any] = {}

    # 约束元数据
    constraint_version: Optional[str] = None
    constraint_source: Optional[str] = None
```

### 3.2 增强请求模型
```python
class EnhancedGenerationRequest(BaseModel):
    """增强生成请求模型"""
    model_config = ConfigDict(protected_namespaces=())

    # 请求标识
    request_id: str
    timestamp: Optional[float] = None

    # 生成参数
    prompt: str
    temperature: float = 0.7
    max_tokens: int = 1024
    top_p: float = 0.9
    frequency_penalty: float = 0.1
    presence_penalty: float = 0.1

    # 约束信息
    constraint_info: ConstraintInfo

    # AUTOSAR上下文
    autosar_context: Dict[str, Any] = {}

    # 客户端信息
    client_version: Optional[str] = None
    client_id: Optional[str] = None
```

### 3.3 云端响应模型
```python
class CloudGenerationResponse(BaseModel):
    """云端生成响应模型"""
    model_config = ConfigDict(protected_namespaces=())

    # 响应标识
    request_id: str
    success: bool
    timestamp: Optional[float] = None

    # 生成结果
    generated_xml: Optional[str] = None
    raw_output: Optional[str] = None

    # 约束应用信息
    constraints_applied: Dict[str, bool] = {}
    constraint_violations: List[str] = []

    # 性能信息
    generation_time: float = 0.0
    model_info: Dict[str, Any] = {}

    # 错误信息
    error_message: Optional[str] = None
    error_details: Dict[str, Any] = {}
```

### 3.4 验证结果模型
```python
class ValidationResult(BaseModel):
    """验证结果模型"""
    overall_valid: bool = False
    stages: Dict[str, Any] = {}
    violations: List[str] = []
    total_time: float = 0.0

    # 扩展验证信息
    validation_level: Optional[str] = None
    failed_stage: Optional[str] = None
    quality_score: Optional[float] = None

class ClientResponse(BaseModel):
    """客户端完整响应模型"""
    request: Any = None  # EnhancedGenerationRequest
    success: bool = False
    generation: Optional[GenerationResponse] = None
    validation: Optional[ValidationResult] = None
    execution_time: float = 0.0
    error: Optional[str] = None

    # 分析结果
    constraint_effectiveness: Optional[Dict] = None
    quality_metrics: Optional[Dict] = None
```

